db.org/t/p/w300/eec3wHYZBtdvfDMqN3nre7V0YwI.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 1","synopsis":"Amano Akari was looking for the western style mansion in the woods becase people say that there is a doll-like young girl there whose appearance has not changed in a long time. Once in the woods however, Akari gets lost. She's saved by a young girl, Sophie, who claims that she's a vampire. However, Sophie doesn't ever attack humans, instead she lives a modern and down to earth life.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eec3wHYZBtdvfDMqN3nre7V0YwI.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13966","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101371","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"37579","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"82736","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"352212","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"49962","synopsis":"After hearing that Akari has moved in with a friend recently, her friend Hinata is concerned who that new friend is. On the way home from school, it's suddenly decided that she'll go meet Sophie at her house. She's shocked to find out that Sophie is a vampire and becomes worried if Akari's safe living together with a vampire who could suck her blood, but...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aZGZXOMDWk1A8GBnhcC3t3Ip1hR.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 2","synopsis":"After hearing that Akari has moved in with a friend recently, her friend Hinata is concerned who that new friend is. On the way home from school, it's suddenly decided that she'll go meet Sophie at her house. She's shocked to find out that Sophie is a vampire and becomes worried if Akari's safe living together with a vampire who could suck her blood, but...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aZGZXOMDWk1A8GBnhcC3t3Ip1hR.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13966","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101371","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"37579","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"82736","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"352212","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"49963","synopsis":"After Akari has left for school, just as Sophie is about to go to bed, she notices that Akari forgot her lunchbox and decides to bring it to her at school. There she meets Akari's friends, Sakuya and Yuu. When she is introduced as a vampire, the horror aficionado Sakuya is keen to find out more. As she is about to leave, Sophie is stopped by a girl from the class who asks her for an odd favor.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mpKikDlTGmc7xc9zJQqIN53OMLz.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"After Akari has left for school, just as Sophie is about to go to bed, she notices that Akari forgot her lunchbox and decides to bring it to her at school. There she meets Akari's friends, Sakuya and Yuu. When she is introduced as a vampire, the horror aficionado Sakuya is keen to find out more. As she is about to leave, Sophie is stopped by a girl from the class who asks her for an odd favor.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mpKikDlTGmc7xc9zJQqIN53OMLz.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13966","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101371","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"37579","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"82736","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"352212","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"49964","synopsis":"As Akari is walking home at night, a winged person passes over her head. Thinking it's Sophie, she chases after them, but it's a girl with golden hair in a ribbon. She says that she's a vampire named Erie, and that she's looking for her friend Sophie. Upon hearing that, Akari takes her to Sophie's house. Erie's overjoyed to see Sophie again and hugs her, but Sophie is anything but thrilled.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3AnGHf2LLwpgB5a9JD2gcjoh7YK.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"As Akari is walking home at night, a winged person passes over her head. Thinking it's Sophie, she chases after them, but it's a girl with golden hair in a ribbon. She says that she's a vampire named Erie, and that she's looking for her friend Sophie. Upon hearing that, Akari takes her to Sophie's house. Erie's overjoyed to see Sophie again and hugs her, but Sophie is anything but thrilled.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3AnGHf2LLwpgB5a9JD2gcjoh7YK.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13966","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101371","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"37579","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"82736","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"352212","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"49965","synopsis":"Sophie spots her neighbor, Mori-san trying to carry a serious load of groceries and decides to help her carrying them. Mori-san explains that she got carried away because she is going to cook their favorite dishes for her daughter and grandchild. She sounds so excited that Sophie is inspired to try cooking something for Akari as well. While Akari is out, Sophie begins cooking with Hinata's help, but...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pQ6C4u3xVWVqySLZ7gTem7zDpSd.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Sophie spots her neighbor, Mori-san trying to carry a serious load of groceries and decides to help her carrying them. Mori-san explains that she got carried away because she is going to cook their favorite dishes for her daughter and grandchild. She sounds so excited that Sophie is inspired to try cooking something for Akari as well. While Akari is out, Sophie begins cooking with Hinata's help, but...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pQ6C4u3xVWVqySLZ7gTem7zDpSd.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13966","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101371","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"37579","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"82736","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"352212","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"49966","synopsis":"Akari's friend Sakuya comes over to Sophie's house. Sakuya is the leader of the Occult Club at school, and wants to write an article about a vampire she knows. Thus she begins interviewing Sophie. Accommodating the request to do what she always does, Sophie opens her laptop and quietly starts to type. However, Sophie begins to worry that her all-too plain behavior is destroying Sakuya's dreams.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mBruN00YOSXp7sdWsgXa89HRFRw.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Akari's friend Sakuya comes over to Sophie's house. Sakuya is the leader of the Occult Club at school, and wants to write an article about a vampire she knows. Thus she begins interviewing Sophie. Accommodating the request to do what she always does, Sophie opens her laptop and quietly starts to type. However, Sophie begins to worry that her all-too plain behavior is destroying Sakuya's dreams.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mBruN00YOSXp7sdWsgXa89HRFRw.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13966","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101371","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"37579","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"82736","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"352212","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"49967","synopsis":"As Akari's summer break has finally begun, she wracks her brain to come up with fun, summery things she can do together with Sophie. However, the ocean or anything outside are all a bad fit for a vampire like Sophie. Then she has a moment of clarity and realized that a firework festival is at night and a summery activity, so she immediately begins preparing yukata. Erie and Hinata and join them to go to the festival, however...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pcErmCAeQbilhlCrMHRU55Emd9u.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"As Akari's summer break has finally begun, she wracks her brain to come up with fun, summery things she can do together with Sophie. However, the ocean or anything outside are all a bad fit for a vampire like Sophie. Then she has a moment of clarity and realized that a firework festival is at night and a summery activity, so she immediately begins preparing yukata. Erie and Hinata and join them to go to the festival, however...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pcErmCAeQbilhlCrMHRU55Emd9u.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpi